You are producing the **subcomponent architecture document** for a
single leaf inside a screen collection — typically one hosted
LiveView, or a shared piece of mounting/loading logic several LiveViews
in the collection depend on. This is the final articulation layer
before implementation. Your `<public-surface>` is what sibling leaves
and `impl_screen` will build against; unlike a UI leaf, this one may
legitimately own a live process (the LiveView itself) and call the
backend.

