# Revising against feedback (surgical modification)

* **Every section is independently sticky** — touch only the section
  the feedback names. The pubapi section is the load-bearing handle
  `impl_screen` and sibling leaves depend on.
* **"Add an event handler to the pubapi"** — edit only pubapi. **"Add
  a dependency on leaf X"** — edit only dependencies, grounded in the
  technical specification. **"Add a process guardrail"** — edit only
  the named process. **"Address review finding #N"** — map the finding
  to one or two sections, modify only those.
